We support the Congress of Councils and its uneasy pact with the Majority Socialists. In March the Landtag returns and elects Johannes Hoffmann premier. The councils remain, for now.

@anarchists
subtitle: The Left Radicals' instinct: councils without a party or a state.
on-arrival: bav_prep += 1; ultraleft_satisfaction += 6; lean_ultraleft += 2; district_bavaria_members += 0.2; unity -= 2

Our Munich comrades join the anarchists' meetings. There is a lot of poetry, and very little organisation.
